      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "This design is implemented and live: the librarian is the single knowledge agent, the ledger holds the backfilled knowledge base, the per-target indexes are built each epoch, and the knowledge tab serves it all. This bundle remains the design record — decisions in the decision log, as-built documentation in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "the knowledge section",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/40-knowledge"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-55-kgr-4": {
      "id": "b-55-kgr-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Knowledge is divided by who keeps it true, not by topic. It has five maintenance regimes: derived, corpus, ledger (events), learnings (beliefs), and authored. Game understanding enters either as raw corpus or as evidence-backed learnings produced during work, never as unowned summaries."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
